<description>&lt;p&gt;A Mexican federal judge was arrested on U.S. charges of taking a $2 million bribe to free a drug trafficker linked to former Olympian Ryan Wedding. A man extradited from Mexico was sentenced to 20 years for a fatal shooting in Longview, and a suspect was pursued in Riverside County before a police shooting near the U.S.-Mexico border. Kidnappings of farmers and villagers continue, illustrating cartel control over rural communities in Mexico. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQNnJnWlVMYkUwX0hPQjVtXzZnNzhBUDhwczhNdnB0dVA3OTJnYTExdnV6ZjRya3M1UUo2TXUyT1l6U0ZRZmh2eUVRNWtJMFBDY2pMQWhaNU9yNm9NWHZGU1UzY2N1TDhwTnh1UXVNNG1YNFBWR2FWZDEzV01mMW0wS1hOcE9hZU1hbFJiaHEtZ0o2SW84T3Q4NDlOYjRTcFdPRnE2SXIzMjFQVHA3UVNZbm1ZaTF2TDhZeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Lufkin Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNbkwtNnMtNmtoTHlFN0g1SE9JSVRRVVBYc3JuUHF1a05BSm5RQkhOU01kV04ybjJFejd5SFlUOUpLcjJtWXAxUWJHUHQwU1dqb3R5Y0ZCUUxLNUdCRWpJMkxBenE3Sk5RSGJ5UlB0OWdNR0FUSGF5UXhiZjhRemZ0emxIZWFuUTRyeWwyZGtvYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTFAyZVc0VjMtR2hpLXdPa2JPSVp2VnE0V3BodXBYR1h1OGI5dWxoTmlYY0dTcHpXcTFaYlJWWmVfMk1MUHI0ZENPVFQxSjRaQWl5YU5aZEplUzFfcE5FNTBBWEhfcUh1ZGFBS0hEdFJUYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Bureau | Sam Cooper | Substack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQSm9hS3haZVR6SFlKM2p4eS1jcWQ1eG4zektGb05WNHZWcHVOZnJBYkdhVG5vU0dxbWdsOFd1aHhYXzFLZjNZY3pZcW5sWXlDUktkcG4tYUc1aFB5REt4dEgtYU9HZ09DcjBieVBqTHZmMUMxbklmMkZOUnhkTW8wUU8wZ1ozNWs1N0xsbnp0ZmZzaTEzeGRKUlJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.